st Guild and build your own tracks.', type: 'Game', genre: 'Racing', source: 'TrackMania (2003)', series: 'TrackMania', players: '1–4', controls: 'R2/W gas, L2/S brake, left stick/arrows steer, Circle/Enter respawn, Triangle/R restart', tags: ['3d', 'arcade', 'vehicles', 'versus', 'retro', 'low-poly'] }\n};\nconst SI = INFO.sourceInformation;\nconst Q = { testing: ['How many issues did testing catch?', 'How many would be considered critical issues / game breaking?', 'What was the most helpful test you ran?', 'What was the least helpful test you ran?'],\n  engine: ['What did you like most about the engine?', 'Did you get stuck or guess wrong?', 'What was the most important thing you had to build yourself?', 'What was the hardest part about using the engine?', 'What did you change in the engine, and why?', 'If you could change one thing about the engine, what would it be?'],\n  prompt: ['What did you like most about this prompt?', 'What was confusing?', 'What was the hardest thing to do?', 'What would you change in this prompt?'] };\nconst qa = (qs, as) => qs.flatMap((q, i) => ['# ' + q, as[i] || 'unknown']);\nexport const ABOUT = { pages: [\n  ['CRACKMANIA', ['# CRACKMANIA v1.0.0', 'An original arcade time-attack stunt racer: block-built tracks with loops, kickers, banked bends and boost pads, a clock to crack, ghosts of your best run, medals, coppers to spend on track pieces, and an editor where every track is blocks on a grid.', '# Modes', 'RACE (15 tracks in 3 environments) · PUZZLE (6) · SURVIVAL (3 gauntlets against the Ghost Guild) · BUILD (the track editor, 6 slots, share codes) · HOT SEAT (2-8 players) · SPLIT SCREEN (2-4) · ONLINE (AI Hub ghost races) · REPLAYS · GARAGE (the paint shop)', '# Inspired by', 'TrackMania (2003) by Nadeo. CRACKMANIA is an original homage and is not affiliated with Nadeo or Ubisoft.']],\n  ['SOURCE INFORMATION', ['# Date', SI.date, '# Source', SI.source, '# Plan', SI.plan, '# Genre and perspective', SI.genre + '. ' + SI.perspective, '# Tech', SI.tech, '# Art direction', SI.artDirection, '# Animation', SI.animation, '# Audio', SI.audio, '# Online', SI.online, '# Testing', SI.testing, '# Research', SI.research, '# Environment', SI.environment, '# Model', SI.model, '# Usage', SI.usage]],\n  ['TESTING FEEDBACK', qa(Q.testing, INFO.testingFeedback)],\n  ['ENGINE FEEDBACK', qa(Q.engine, INFO.engineFeedback)],\n  ['PROMPT FEEDBACK', qa(Q.prompt, INFO.promptFeedback)],\n  ['CREDITS', ['# Design, code, art, music and sound', 'Made by code: every model, texture, song, sound and voice in this game is generated at run time.', '# Built on', 'my-3D2dge v0.85.2 (MIT) - the 2D engine and its 3D engine', 'three.js r182 (MIT)', 'Rapier 0.19.3 (Apache-2.0)', 'AI Hub session client 1.4.0', '# Characters', 'Coco Asphalte, track architect · Monsieur Drapeau, flag man · Tex Mirage, Mlle Gravillon and Bobo Yeti, the Ghost Guild', '# Thanks', 'Nadeo, for TrackMania (2003), the toy box this game plays in.']]\n], Q };\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Add right-click back to menus and the About data source"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16361,"cache_read_input_tokens":560712,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16361},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66d97bf5-dd15-40b7-85f8-8eecadfc963f","uuid":"6f37657f-a2bb-41c7-b034-321dd54e7af4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:53:44.275Z","request_id":"req_011CghvMiAygd8eE32YQD1RM","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01598NyfRseAjZFBMXB2qutB":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/scenes/menu.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (I.pressed('cancel') || (I.pressed('Mouse2' in {} ? 'cancel' : 'cancel'))) { back(); return; }\",\"if (I.pressed('cancel')) { back(); return; }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/input.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"export const MENU_INPUT = Object.assign({}, MOVES, {\",\"export const MENU_INPUT = Object.assign({}, MOVES, { cancel: ['Escape', 'Backspace', 'Mouse2', 'Pad1'],\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat > src/data/about.js <<'EOF'\n// CRACKMANIA About / Credits: the single source for the in-game pages, the final reply and exit-interview.json\n// (tools/exit-interview.mjs writes the JSON from INFO)\nexport const INFO = {\n  sourceInformation: {\n    date: '2026-11-04 05:03:08', source: 'TrackMania (2003, Nadeo)', plan: 'PLAN.md',\n    genre: 'Arcade racing (time attack) with a track-building puzzle mode', perspective: 'Third-person chase camera (far, close, hood) in races; orbiting three-quarter camera in the editor and puzzles; trackside TV cameras in replays',\n    tech: 'unknown', artDirection: 'unknown', animation: 'unknown', audio: 'unknown', online: 'unknown', testing: 'unknown', research: 'unknown',\n    environment: 'Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux; browser unknown', model: 'Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5, reasoning effort xhigh', usage: 'unknown'\n  },\n  testingFeedback: ['unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown'],\n  engineFeedback: ['unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown'],\n  promptFeedback: ['unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown', 'unknown'],\n  aiHub: { name: 'CRACKMANIA', tagline: 'Crack the clock.', description: 'Block-built stunt tracks, loops and canyon jumps against the clock: race, solve track puzzles, survive the Ghost Guild and build your own tracks.', type: 'Game', genre: 'Racing', source: 'TrackMania (2003)', series: 'TrackMania', players: '1–4', controls: 'R2/W gas, L2/S brake, left stick/arrows steer, Circle/Enter respawn, Triangle/R restart', tags: ['3d', 'arcade', 'vehicles', 'versus', 'retro', 'low-poly'] }\n};\nconst SI = INFO.sourceInformation;\nconst Q = { testing: ['How many issues did testing catch?', 'How many would be considered critical issues / game breaking?', 'What was the most helpful test you ran?', 'What was the least helpful test you ran?'],\n  engine: ['What did you like most about the engine?', 'Did you get stuck or guess wrong?', 'What was the most important thing you had to build yourself?', 'What was the hardest part about using the engine?', 'What did you change in the engine, and why?', 'If you could change one thing about the engine, what would it be?'],\n  prompt: ['What did you like most about this prompt?', 'What was confusing?', 'What was the hardest thing to do?', 'What would you change in this prompt?'] };\nconst qa = (qs, as) => qs.flatMap((q, i) => ['# ' + q, as[i] || 'unknown']);\nexport const ABOUT = { pages: [\n  ['CRACKMANIA', ['# CRACKMANIA v1.0.0', 'An original arcade time-attack stunt racer: block-built tracks with loops, kickers, banked bends and boost pads, a clock to crack, ghosts of your best run, medals, coppers to spend on track pieces, and an editor where every track is blocks on a grid.', '# Modes', 'RACE (15 tracks in 3 environments) · PUZZLE (6) · SURVIVAL (3 gauntlets against the Ghost Guild) · BUILD (the track editor, 6 slots, share codes) · HOT SEAT (2-8 players) · SPLIT SCREEN (2-4) · ONLINE (AI Hub ghost races) · REPLAYS · GARAGE (the paint shop)', '# Inspired by', 'TrackMania (2003) by Nadeo. CRACKMANIA is an original homage and is not affiliated with Nadeo or Ubisoft.']],\n  ['SOURCE INFORMATION', ['# Date', SI.date, '# Source', SI.source, '# Plan', SI.plan, '# Genre and perspective', SI.genre + '. ' + SI.perspective, '# Tech', SI.tech, '# Art direction', SI.artDirection, '# Animation', SI.animation, '# Audio', SI.audio, '# Online', SI.online, '# Testing', SI.testing, '# Research', SI.research, '# Environment', SI.environment, '# Model', SI.model, '# Usage', SI.usage]],\n  ['TESTING FEEDBACK', qa(Q.testing, INFO.testingFeedback)],\n  ['ENGINE FEEDBACK', qa(Q.engine, INFO.engineFeedback)],\n  ['PROMPT FEEDBACK', qa(Q.prompt, INFO.promptFeedback)],\n  ['CREDITS', ['# Design, code, art, music and sound', 'Made by code: every model, texture, song, sound and voice in this game is generated at run time.', '# Built on', 'my-3D2dge v0.85.2 (MIT) - the 2D engine and its 3D engine', 'three.js r182 (MIT)', 'Rapier 0.19.3 (Apache-2.0)', 'AI Hub session client 1.4.0', '# Characters', 'Coco Asphalte, track architect · Monsieur Drapeau, flag man · Tex Mirage, Mlle Gravillon and Bobo Yeti, the Ghost Guild', '# Thanks', 'Nadeo, for TrackMania (2003), the toy box this game plays in.']]\n], Q };\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Add right-click back to menus and the About data source"}}}
